    enonce: "<span class=\"q\">1) </span>فكّك إلى جداء عوامل: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = (<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"den\">2</span></span>x + 4)(-8x - <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"den\">3</span></span>) - (-32x - <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"den\">3</span></span>)(-<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">2</span></span>x + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"den\">3</span></span>)</span><br><span class=\"q\">2) </span>فكّك إلى جداء عوامل: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = (-x - 1)(2x + 3) - (4x + 6)(<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span>x - <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span>)</span><br><span class=\"q\">3) </span>فكّك إلى جداء عوامل: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = (-5x - <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"den\">3</span></span>)(-2x - <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span>) - <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"den\">2</span></span>(2x + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span>)</span><br><span class=\"q\">4) </span>فكّك إلى جداء عوامل: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = (-2)x(-<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span>x - <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"den\">3</span></span>) + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span>x + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"den\">3</span></span></span>",
